===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# anything that [[propel]]s
## [[fuel]], [[oxidizer]], reaction mass or [[mixture]] for one or more [[engine]]s (especially [[internal combustion engine]]s or [[jet engine]]s) that is carried within a vehicle prior to use
## the [[compressed]] [[gas]] in a [[pressurised]] [[container]] (especially an [[aerosol]] can) that is used to expel its content
##* {{quote-journal|en|author=Jessica Hall|title=Nanoengineers build 'microcannons' that fire light-up bullets filled with drugs|magazine=w:ExtremeTech|url=https://www.extremetech.com/extreme/221187-nanoscientists-build-microcannons-that-fire-light-up-nanobullets-filled-with-drugs|date=2016-01-14|passage=Then they backed the membrane with a gel matrix containing a perfluorocarbon (PFC) '''propellant''' and fluorescent "nanobullets" about a micron wide, and hit it with ultrasound.}}
## the [[explosive]] {{qf|cordite, gunpowder, etc}} found in [[ammunition]] [[cartridge]]s

